Description: SONiC YANG model generator
 This package provides pre-generated SONiC YANG models converted from
 OpenConfig annotation YANG files, and a runtime CLI generation script.
 .
 The YANG files are generated at build time and packaged for deployment.
 Build-time tools (libyang, Python bindings) are NOT included in the package.
 This package provides tools to automatically generate SONiC YANG models
 from OpenConfig annotation YANG files and auto-generate CLI commands.
 Uses python3-libyang4 Python bindings for YANG processing.

